She just looks at him and says, no job.
她只是看着他说，没工作了。

1381
01:02:14.020 --> 01:02:14.800
No job.
没工作了。

1382
01:02:15.220 --> 01:02:21.580
Also, she has a line that, again, I just want a whole line of mugs that are Joe phrases.
另外，她有一句台词，我真的想出一整套印有Joe语录的马克杯。

1383
01:02:22.220 --> 01:02:23.060
Here's the line.
台词是这样的。

1384
01:02:23.060 --> 01:02:26.940
Stop asking yourself easy questions so you can look like a genius.
别再问自己那些简单的问题来装天才了。

1385
01:02:28.420 --> 01:02:29.180
That's really good.
那句真的很棒。

1386
01:02:29.180 --> 01:02:29.620
Love it.
太喜欢了。

1387
01:02:29.880 --> 01:02:30.360
I know.
我知道。

1388
01:02:30.460 --> 01:02:31.540
They wrote so well for her.
编剧为她写的台词太好了。

1389
01:02:32.160 --> 01:02:37.900
After this scene in the shooting draft would have been a scene between Aaron and Gabe in the break room.
在拍摄剧本中，这场戏之后原本应该是一场Aaron和Gabe在休息室的戏。

1390
01:02:38.080 --> 01:02:40.040
It would sort of wrapped up their storyline.
那本可以为他们的故事线做一个收尾。

1391
01:02:40.600 --> 01:02:43.680
I'm going to call it cringiest in the break room.
我要把它称为休息室里最尴尬的时刻。

1392
01:02:43.680 --> 01:02:44.000
Ooh.
噢。

1393
01:02:44.300 --> 01:02:45.740
He writes her a poem.
他给她写了一首诗。

1394
01:02:45.940 --> 01:02:46.400
Oh, no.
噢，不。

1395
01:02:46.560 --> 01:02:47.520
I want you to hear it.
我想让你听听。

1396
01:02:47.580 --> 01:02:48.320
No, God.
不，天哪。

1397
01:02:48.900 --> 01:02:53.860
You charm me with a smile, a wink, and make me laugh like Monsters, Inc.
你的微笑和眨眼让我着迷，让我笑得像《怪兽电力公司》一样。

1398
01:02:54.480 --> 01:02:55.960
We'll go and eat some ratatouille.
我们要去吃点料理鼠王。

1399
01:02:56.160 --> 01:02:57.600
I sure hope it's not too chewy.
我真希望它不会太难嚼。

1400
01:03:06.360 --> 01:03:11.100
You know, bless his heart for referencing her favorite films, finally.
你知道，他终于提到了她最喜欢的电影，真是难为他了。

1401
01:03:11.400 --> 01:03:17.240
But Gabe, maybe, maybe if you had done that earlier, things wouldn't have gone south.
但是盖博，也许，也许如果你早点那么做，事情就不会变得这么糟糕了。

1402
01:03:17.540 --> 01:03:20.000
He binged all the Disney movies she loves.
他一口气看完了她喜欢的所有迪士尼电影。

1403
01:03:20.160 --> 01:03:25.120
He also goes on to say, I'm sorry that I said you spend too much money on stickers.
他还接着说，我很抱歉说你在贴纸上花太多钱了。

1404
01:03:26.060 --> 01:03:27.700
He really makes a big apology.
他真的做了一个郑重的道歉。

1405
01:03:27.960 --> 01:03:29.020
But she's done.
但她已经受够了。

1406
01:03:29.160 --> 01:03:29.620
She's done.
她受够了。

1407
01:03:30.020 --> 01:03:32.720
This episode ends with Joe in the conference room.
这一集以乔在会议室结束。

1408
01:03:33.020 --> 01:03:34.640
She's meeting with Gabe, Jim, and Toby.
她正在和盖博、吉姆还有托比开会。

1409
01:03:34.820 --> 01:03:37.360
And she explains, you are my search committee.
她解释说，你们就是我的搜寻委员会。

1410
01:03:37.560 --> 01:03:40.420
You are tasked with finding her a new manager.
你们的任务是为她找一位新经理。

1411
01:03:40.920 --> 01:03:45.400
And until that time, the person with the most seniority will be the new acting manager.
在此之前，资历最深的人将担任代理经理。

1412
01:03:45.400 --> 01:03:46.180
Who is that?
那是谁？

1413
01:03:46.320 --> 01:03:46.840
Who is it?
是谁？

1414
01:03:46.900 --> 01:03:48.320
Who has the most seniority?
谁的资历最深？

1415
01:03:48.460 --> 01:03:51.760
The looks they give each other because they all know it's Creed.
他们互相对视的眼神，因为他们都知道是克里德。

1416
01:03:52.200 --> 01:03:53.480
So priceless.
真是无价。

1417
01:03:55.120 --> 01:03:57.880
The episode will end with a tag.
这一集将以一个彩蛋结束。

1418
01:03:58.160 --> 01:04:01.780
And it is Angela, Daryl, and Kevin back at the copier.
是安吉拉、达里尔和凯文在复印机旁。

1419
01:04:02.080 --> 01:04:04.400
This was not in the shooting draft.
这在拍摄剧本里是没有的。

1420
01:04:04.620 --> 01:04:11.420
In fact, the tag in the shooting draft was Ryan and Andy helping Kelly with her American Idol audition.
事实上，拍摄剧本里的彩蛋是瑞安和安迪帮凯莉准备《美国偶像》的试镜。

1421
01:04:11.880 --> 01:04:12.160
Okay.
好的。

1422
01:04:12.920 --> 01:04:18.760
Justin shared in the DVD commentary that this whole tag with us by the copier was completely improvised.
贾斯汀在DVD评论中分享说，我们复印机旁这一整段彩蛋完全是即兴发挥的。

1423
01:04:18.980 --> 01:04:20.840
That's exactly how I remember it.
我记得就是那样。

1424
01:04:21.040 --> 01:04:23.360
It was so much flippin' fun.
真的超级好玩。

1425
01:04:23.600 --> 01:04:26.700
They literally just put the cameras on us and let it roll.
他们真的是把摄像机架在我们面前，然后就开拍了。

1426
01:04:27.020 --> 01:04:27.540
Wait.
等等。

1427
01:04:27.780 --> 01:04:34.200
So you were just listing numbers and then Kevin says, oh, sorry, I did a three instead of a two.
所以你当时只是在念数字，然后凯文说，哦，抱歉，我按了三而不是二。

1428
01:04:35.000 --> 01:04:37.020
I literally was just reading out numbers.
我当时真的只是在念数字。

1429
01:04:37.020 --> 01:04:39.440
I had like just written a bunch of numbers on a piece of paper.
我当时就在一张纸上写了一堆数字。

1430
01:04:40.280 --> 01:04:42.900
When Craig jumps in, that was improvised.
当克雷格加入进来时，那是即兴的。

1431
01:04:43.040 --> 01:04:48.080
When Oscar jumps in, improvised how I react to Oscar, improvised all of it improvised.
当奥斯卡加入进来时，我对奥斯卡的反应是即兴的，所有的一切都是即兴的。

1432
01:04:48.740 --> 01:04:49.880
I want to play it.
我想放出来听听。

1433
01:04:50.200 --> 01:04:50.640
Please.
请吧。

1434
01:04:50.860 --> 01:04:52.920
I love it so much.
我太喜欢这段了。

1435
01:04:55.040 --> 01:04:58.520
Four, one, seven, one.
四，一，七，一。

1436
01:04:58.860 --> 01:04:59.620
Another one?
再来一个？

1437
01:04:59.720 --> 01:04:59.960
Yes!
好！

1438
01:05:00.640 --> 01:05:04.700
Seven, two, six, nine.
七，二，六，九。

1439
01:05:04.880 --> 01:05:05.380
Shut up, Oscar.
闭嘴，奥斯卡。

1440
01:05:05.560 --> 01:05:05.800
Eight.
八。

1441
01:05:06.240 --> 01:05:06.780
Nine firSt.
先说九。

1442
01:05:06.860 --> 01:05:07.180
Put the nine.
把九放上去。

1443
01:05:07.280 --> 01:05:21.020
Nine, eight, five, three, zero, zero, again, zero, four, six, two, one.
九，八，五，三，零，零，再来，零，四，六，二，一。

1444
01:05:21.020 --> 01:05:21.700
Oh, I hit three.
哦，我按到三了。

1445
01:05:21.760 --> 01:05:22.540
I hit three instead.
我按成三了。

1446
01:05:22.540 --> 01:05:23.100
Oh, God!
天哪！

1447
01:05:27.640 --> 01:05:29.940
Are the multiple zeros in a row?
是有好几个零连在一起吗？

1448
01:05:31.100 --> 01:05:35.660
Because I've had those where you're trying to explain, maybe it's your credit card, maybe
因为我遇到过这种情况，你试图解释，也许是你的信用卡，也许

1449
01:05:35.660 --> 01:05:40.100
it's a pin number or something, and you have to make sure that the person knows.
是密码之类的，你必须确保对方听清楚了。

1450
01:05:40.100 --> 01:05:41.520
You mean another one.
你是说再来一个。

1451
01:05:41.640 --> 01:05:41.820
Yeah.
是啊。

1452
01:05:42.020 --> 01:05:45.100
I just love, too, when Craig was like, no, no, hit nine again.
我也特别喜欢克雷格说“不，不，再按一次九”的时候。

1453
01:05:45.240 --> 01:05:46.260
And I'm like, and then eight.
我就说，然后是八。

1454
01:05:46.440 --> 01:05:48.860
And then Oscar's like, you guys, the beeping.
然后奥斯卡说，你们几个，那哔哔声。

1455
01:05:49.080 --> 01:05:51.340
And I keep going, four, two, shut up, Oscar.
我一直按，四，二，闭嘴，奥斯卡。

1456
01:05:51.560 --> 01:05:51.840
Nine.
九。

1457
01:05:53.260 --> 01:05:54.900
We had such a good time.
我们玩得太开心了。

1458
01:05:54.900 --> 01:05:56.180
We could have done it all day.
我们本来可以玩上一整天的。

1459
01:05:56.180 --> 01:05:58.440
And I love that they left it in as the tag.
我很高兴他们把这段留在了片尾彩蛋里。

1460
01:05:58.440 --> 01:06:01.180
Well, guys, that was Dwight K.
好了，各位，刚才那是德怀特·K·

1461
01:06:01.380 --> 01:06:03.320
Schrute, Acting Manager.
施鲁特，代理经理。

1462
01:06:03.740 --> 01:06:07.160
Next week, we'll be back with Search Committee Part 1.
下周，我们将回归“搜寻委员会（上）”。

1463
01:06:07.680 --> 01:06:09.880
We're getting to the end of Season 7.
第七季快要结束了。

1464
01:06:10.240 --> 01:06:11.620
Where is the time going?
时间都去哪儿了？

1465
01:06:11.640 --> 01:06:13.220
This is flying by, Jenna.
过得太快了，珍娜。

1466
01:06:13.540 --> 01:06:14.100
I know.
我知道。

1467
01:06:14.280 --> 01:06:15.660
It's because we're having so much fun.
那是因为我们玩得太开心了。

1468
01:06:15.780 --> 01:06:16.320
It is.
确实。

1469
01:06:16.540 --> 01:06:19.060
Thanks, you guys, so much for listening and re-watching with us.
非常感谢大家收听并与我们一起重温。

1470
01:06:19.140 --> 01:06:20.000
We'll see you next week.
我们下周见。

1471
01:06:20.120 --> 01:06:20.560
See you then.
到时候见。

1472
01:06:20.560 --> 01:06:27.330
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

